{"unit_id":"Xidong-AI__dsh-rate-limiter#card-zh","repo":"Xidong-AI/dsh-rate-limiter","commit":"594300e6fa55de8d411996e914a2fa06b3832432","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@xidong-ai/dsh-rate-limiter 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的主动限速插件。它挂接 agent/request，在请求发出前按供应商使用令牌桶控制速率；令牌不足时延迟排队，并支持中止等待。可分别配置补充速率与突发容量，也能通过设置面板管理配置。适合需要控制不同模型供应商请求频率的 DSH 用户。未配置的供应商直接放行；无需额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.ts:117-143","lib/limiter.ts:42-141","lib/config.ts:42-57"]}
{"unit_id":"Xidong-AI__dsh-rate-limiter#card-en","repo":"Xidong-AI/dsh-rate-limiter","commit":"594300e6fa55de8d411996e914a2fa06b3832432","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@xidong-ai/dsh-rate-limiter limits DSH web requests per provider with a token bucket before dispatch. Requests wait when tokens run short and can be aborted. Configure refill rate and burst capacity in the settings panel. Unconfigured providers pass through; no API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.ts:117-143","lib/limiter.ts:42-141","lib/config.ts:42-57"]}
